简洁干净，整体呈现现代口腔诊室的专业感，写实风格，自然光影，8k高细节。\n\n视角4：鸟瞰俯视（桌面与墙面布局）\n室内白色墙面诊室俯视视角，灰色办公桌位于画面下方前景，桌面透明牙模与A4文件布局清晰，浅景深使前景微微虚化，右侧墙面蓝色六边形边框内嵌口腔CT影像装饰框位于画面右上方，白色墙面干净整洁，整体空间布局专业有序，写实风格，高分辨率。\n\n"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 20, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [263.2095642089844, 88], "pos": [569.3878173828125, 268.2899169921875], "id": 14, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.73", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [64], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "size": [140, 46], "pos": [1305.7608642578125, 731.3797607421875], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 10, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 11, "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {}, "id": 11, "type": "VAEDecode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.76", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecode"}, "order": 19}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}, {"name": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "size": [270, 78], "pos": [1709.300048828125, 545.45361328125], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 64, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "id": 35, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {